<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="Access denied">
<meta name="author" content="">
<title>E2Guardian - Harmful Content</title>
<!-- Bootstrap core CSS -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="//maxcdn.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/3.3.4/css/bootstrap.min.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="//maxcdn.bootstrapcdn.com/font-awesome/4.3.0/css/font-awesome.min.css">
<style>
/* Error Page Inline Styles */
body {
  padding-top: 20px;
}
/* Layout */
.jumbotron {
  font-size: 21px;
  font-weight: 200;
  line-height: 2.1428571435;
  color: inherit;
  padding: 10px 0px;
}
/* Everything but the jumbotron gets side spacing for mobile-first views */
.masthead, .body-content, {
  padding-left: 15px;
  padding-right: 15px;
}
/* Main marketing message and sign up button */
.jumbotron {
  text-align: center;
  background-color: transparent;
}
.jumbotron .btn {
  font-size: 21px;
  padding: 14px 24px;
}
/* Colors */
.green {color:#5cb85c;}
.orange {color:#f0ad4e;}
.red {color:#d9534f;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<!-- Error Page Content -->
<div class="container">
  <!-- Jumbotron -->
  <div class="jumbotron">
    <h1><i class="fa fa-cogs red"></i> E2G 4.1 Harmful Content</h1>
    <p class="lead">The automatic system protecting the CTTB network has detected harmful content on the page you were trying to reach.</p>
{% if item.bypass %}
    <p>If you believe this is a mistake please use the button below to proceed</p>
    <a href="-BYPASS-" class="btn btn-success btn-lg text-center">Continue Anyway</a>
{% endif %}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container">
  <div class="body-content">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <h2>What happened?</h2>
        <p class="lead">The internet has a bit of everything and websites can be a source of viruses and other malware and/or contain improper content.</p>
        <p>In the hope to avoid exposure to harmful material an automatic system tries to identify and block bad websites. Because the process is done by a machine sometimes the content is misidentified.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <h2>What can I do?</h2>
        <p class="lead">If you believe the site has been erroneusly identified you can report it.</p>
        <p>Reports can be made via email to cttb-it@drba.org</p>
     </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<!-- End Error Page Content -->
<!--Scripts-->
<!-- jQuery library -->
<script src="//ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jquery/1.11.1/jquery.min.js"></script>
<script src="//maxcdn.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/3.3.4/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
